  "hints": [
    "Four subnets need two extra network bits: /24 becomes /26, which is 255.255.255.192.",
    "A /26 holds 64 addresses, so the subnets start at .0, .64, .128 and .192.",
    "The Admin PC can be 192.168.10.2 /26 with gateway 192.168.10.1; the Library PC can be 192.168.10.194 /26 with gateway 192.168.10.193."
